ChatVoyeur v1.02 - User actions shower, message sender for Zeus
---------------------------------------------------------------

WHAT IT DOES
~~~~~~~~~~~~

The same as Voyeur (not iconify nor popup) and SendToLine plus
that ChatVoyeur can start/exit the chat-program and send and 
show files while in chat mode.


WHY IT'S GREAT
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

You can configurate all the colors and have text files shown 
before and after a chat. It can be used as a sysop pager and
save a 40 character long message to the sysop from the pager.
It 'remembers' up to 128 requests for 32767 lines (the lines
0 to 127 has each one request line while the rest shares the
last line).
When you want to send a message to a user, you can choose if
it should be shown at once or if it should be hold untill the
user isn't doing anything serius. The message can be more than
one row long.

To get some more information look at ChatVoyeur.guide

HISTORY
~~~~~~~

1.01:  New features - send message, show textfile, send file,
       start usereditor, hangup user (kick).

1.02:  Major bug fix - Had a to small array.


